{"id":"d30a215bc9db4b5d","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-variable.md","title":"带标签的可数变量","display":"df-variable — 带标签的可数变量","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-variable","aliases":["43-df-variable"],"display":"df-variable — 带标签的可数变量","depends_on":[],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"本目录内建一阶逻辑语法/语义支撑；原书仅预设通常逻辑，未定位到独立对应条目","source_scope":"local-support","verification_status":"definition-reviewed","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-variable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-variable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-variable — 带标签的可数变量"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"本目录内建一阶逻辑语法/语义支撑；原书仅预设通常逻辑，未定位到独立对应条目"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"local-support"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-reviewed"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>以有序对编码语法符号，变量标签0与语言符号及语法构造标签分离。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"x_n:=(0,n)\\quad(n\\in\\mathbb N),\\qquad\\operatorname{Var}:=\\{x_n:n\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{Variable}(x)\\Longleftrightarrow x\\in\\operatorname{Var}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[x_n:=(0,n)\\quad(n\\in\\mathbb N),\\qquad\\operatorname{Var}:=\\{x_n:n\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{Variable}(x)\\Longleftrightarrow x\\in\\operatorname{Var}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>显式单射编码保证变量两两不同，不再由未解释的x_n名称推断可数无穷性。</p>\n<p>来源：本目录内建一阶逻辑语法/语义支撑；原书仅预设通常逻辑，未定位到独立对应条目。版本为用户提供的 2007-07-28 草稿。 此项为支撑原有形式化的一阶逻辑基础，非声称原书有独立同名定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"x_n:=(0,n)\\quad(n\\in\\mathbb N),\\qquad\\operatorname{Var}:=\\{x_n:n\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{Variable}(x)\\Longleftrightarrow x\\in\\operatorname{Var}.","display":true}],"bytes":1192,"backlinks":[{"id":"b88be0fc886200c3","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"809479f98d99c157","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L$ 为集合论元语言中的候选签名；$n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$，函数符号族与关系符号族均以 $\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$ 为索引域。$C,(F_n)_{n\\ge1},(R_n)_{n\\ge1}$ 为集合与集合族；$\\operatorname{Var}=\\{(0,n):n\\in\\mathbb N\\}$ 采用 [[43-df-variable]]。$\\operatorname{Lang}_1$ 是满足下式的签名类；非逻辑符号的第二分量允许任意集合标签。"},{"id":"1a4ba10013f4fc82","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"961683c3b48a18ae","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L\\in\\operatorname{Lang}_1$；$f\\in L_{\\rm Func,n}$、$n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$，$\\bar t=(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)$ 为有限元组。变量和非逻辑符号的标签采用 [[43-df-variable]]、[[43-df-first-order-language]]。$f(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)$ 是下式定义的语法对象。"},{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-499","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-variable]] — 带标签的可数变量"}],"outgoing":[]}